comments[6]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-13T22:04:10.579Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check: pm-eq9dlw fixed capture and pm-5q8wa0 made legacy rows advisory, but both are terminal and neither owns repair or severity migration; GH-998 is the canonical external report."
  "2026-08-14T23:25:31.631Z","harness:codex","Implementation start 2026-08-15: active in the coupled workspace-integrity tranche spanning provenance repair, self-indexing health severity, extension-host version coherence, cross-version history repair, and strict linked-artifact parsing. Only these five canonical regression items are claimed; all other tracker work remains open and unclaimed."
  "2026-08-15T01:56:43.700Z","harness:codex","Delivery evidence 2026-08-15: provenance health now streams a privacy-safe census, classifies invalid legacy values, and exposes dry-run/apply normalization through SDK, CLI, MCP metadata, contracts, and executable remediation. Receipts disclose aggregate mutation evidence without leaking raw author values. Focused linked tests passed 30/30; packed temp-workspace normalization removed the invalid observation and the repaired chain verified; full release verification passed 7,334 tests and exact 100/100/100/100 coverage."
  "2026-08-15T02:06:27.586Z","harness:codex","Review follow-up evidence 2026-08-15: bulk normalization now preserves drifted_streams as the actual drift population instead of conflating it with the provenance-only target union. A temporary legacy-epoch fixture proves drifted_streams=0, provenance_invalid_streams=1, and one repaired dry-run row before apply. Focused test, typecheck, and the complete static assurance chain pass."
  "2026-08-15T02:58:01.776Z","harness:codex","PR #1016 review evidence 2026-08-15: provenance normalization census now short-circuits on the first invalid observation without allocating a parsed stream array, while intentionally retaining complete reads so repair discovery cannot silently omit later events. Privacy assertions parse repaired events and verify invalid dimensions/values structurally. Focused tests and exact 7,337-test 100/100/100/100 coverage pass."
  "2026-08-15T03:01:37.092Z","harness:codex","Final review evidence: linked provenance contracts passed 30/30 tests. Census now parses incrementally and stops at the first invalid provenance entry without silently bounding complete repair discovery."
